{"title": "Rig groups", "parts": {"lead": "<p class=lead>Two cameras &amp; an IMU.</p><div class=chips><span class=chip>2 cameras</span></div>", "glance": "<p>Two cameras &amp; an IMU.</p><div class=band><figure class=demo><video src=\"/media/sensors/rig-groups/demo.mp4\" poster=\"/media/sensors/rig-groups/demo.jpg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline controls preload=metadata></video><figcaption>C</figcaption></figure><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=tiles><div><span>Reprojection median</span><b>0.21<small> px</small></b></div><div><span>cam0–cam1 baseline</span><b>62.0<small> mm</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 td</span><b>+1.50<small> ms</small></b></div><div><span>cam0 lever arm</span><b>30.5<small> mm</small></b></div></div></div></div><p class=sd-note>Reprojection is how far, in pixels, the detected corners lie from where the solve puts them. td is the camera–IMU time offset, and the lever arm is the camera–IMU position offset.</p><p class=sd-note>One recording.</p>", "process": "<p>The path of the rig around the board, as MVIS solved it. Press Play or drag the bar to follow it. Use the buttons to change the view.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=proc-wrap><button type=button class=proc-open hidden><svg viewBox=\"0 0 400 220\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"138.2,176.3 201.5,200.0 264.8,176.3 201.5,152.6 138.2,176.3\" fill=\"var(--strong)\" fill-opacity=\".1\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/><polyline points=\"159.3,45.8 168.0,35.3 157.8,25.0 135.2,20.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span>Explore in 3D (about 5 MB)</span></button><div class=procplot id=\"proc0\"></div><div class=\"mvis-progress\" data-plot=\"proc0\"><button type=button>▶︎ Play</button><select class=\"mvis-progress-cam\" aria-label=\"Camera shown\"><option value=\"0\">cam0</option><option value=\"1\">cam1</option></select><input type=range min=0 max=11 value=11 step=1 aria-label=\"Calibration progress\"><span class=\"mvis-progress-label\">Loading</s