v><div class=bar><span>Accel scale y</span><i><u style=\"left:50.00%;width:12.50%\"></u></i><b>+2.00 %</b></div><div class=bar><span>Accel scale z</span><i><u style=\"left:31.25%;width:18.75%\"></u></i><b>−3.00 %</b></div><div class=bar><span></span><em><s>−8 %</s><s>0</s><s>+8 %</s></em><b></b></div></div></div>", "timing": "<p>The time offsets, to scale. td is the camera–IMU time offset, with t_imu = t_cam + td.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=chart><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 136\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Time offsets in milliseconds, to scale\"><line class=\"g\" x1=70.0 x2=70.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=70.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-10 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=177.5 x2=177.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=177.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>-5 ms</text><line class=\"g z\" x1=285.0 x2=285.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=285.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+0 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=392.5 x2=392.5 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=392.5 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+5 ms</text><line class=\"g\" x1=500.0 x2=500.0 y1=4 y2=112 /><text x=500.0 y=128 text-anchor=middle>+10 ms</text><text x=0 y=22>cam0 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=317.2 y1=18 y2=18 /><circle class=dot cx=317.2 cy=18 r=5 /><text x=326.2 y=22 text-anchor=start>+1.50</text><text x=0 y=56>cam1 td</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=319.4 y1=52 y2=52 /><circle class=dot cx=319.4 cy=52 r=5 /><text x=328.4 y=56 text-anchor=start>+1.60</text><text x=0 y=90>t_ga</text><line class=stem x1=285.0 x2=231.2 y1=86 y2=86 /><circle class=dot cx=231.2 cy=86 r=5 /><text x=222.2 y=90 text-anchor=end>−2.50</text></svg></div></div>", "results": "<p>Rotation is log(R) in rad, camera in the IMU frame.</p><div class=v data-v=\"0\"><div class=scroll><table class=num><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>MVIS</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=grp><th colspan=2>cam0</th></tr><tr><td>fx px</td><td>300.00</td></tr><tr><td>fy px</td><td>300.00</td></tr><tr><td>cx px</td><td>320.00</td></tr><tr><td>cy px</td><td>240.00</td></tr><tr><td>k1</td><td>0.01000</td></